# 23. Lightning Web Application

# CC Practical — College Management Lightning Application

## Aim

To develop a College Management Lightning Application in Salesforce to manage Student and Faculty records with validation rules for ensuring data accuracy.

---

# Requirements

## Student Validations

- Marks should be between 0 and 100
- Roll number must be greater than 0
- Email must contain `@`
- Student name cannot be blank

---

## Faculty Validations

- Faculty name must contain at least 3 characters
- Faculty ID must be greater than 0 and unique
- Salary must be between 10,000 and 500,000
- Department must be selected
- Joining date cannot be future date

