# PART 3 — Student Validation Rules

## Navigation

```
Object Manager → Student → Validation Rules → New
```

---

# Validation 1 — Marks Validation

## Rule Name

```
Marks_Validation
```

## Formula

```
OR(
    Marks__c < 0,
    Marks__c > 100
)
```

## Error Message

```
Marks should be between 0 and 100
```

Click Save.

---

# Validation 2 — Roll Number Validation

## Rule Name

```
RollNumber_Validation
```

## Formula

```
Roll_Number__c <= 0
```

## Error Message

```
Roll number must be greater than 0
```

Save.

---

# Validation 3 — Student Name Validation

## Rule Name

```
StudentName_Validation
```

## Formula

```
ISBLANK(Name)
```

## Error Message

```
Student name cannot be blank
```

Save.

---

# Validation 4 — Email Validation

## Rule Name

```
Email_Validation
```

## Formula

```
NOT(CONTAINS(Email__c, "@"))
```

## Error Message

```
Email must contain @ symbol
```

Save.

